  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Sharp, persistent swings in oil and gas prices elevate market risk premia and policymaker concern about resource-driven competition, directly raising perceived geopolitical risk between major powers including the US and China.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">mid_east_energy_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_trade_rivalry</data>
</edge>
