<edge source="mid_east_energy_shock::sanctions_enforcement_in" target="ai_safety_militarization::model_dev_velocity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter sanctions enforcement blocks exports of high-end accelerators, cloud services and specialized software to targeted actors, directly reducing their capacity to train large models and thus slowing local model development velocity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">mid_east_energy_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_safety_militarization</data>
</edge>
<edge source="mid_east_energy_shock::sanctions_enforcement_in" target="global_rate_repricing::cross_border_flows" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter, actively enforced sanctions disrupt correspondent banking relationships and close payment corridors for targeted jurisdictions and counterparties, directly reducing bank and portfolio capital flows into and out of those jurisdictions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">mid_east_energy_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">global_rate_repricing</data>
</edge>
<edge source="mid_east_energy_shock::sanctions_enforcement_in" target="russia_ukraine_war::energy_flow_stability" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter and more aggressive enforcement of sanctions and interdictions in the Middle East raises inspection, seizure and insurance risks for energy shipments, prompting route cancellations, transshipment delays and carrier avoidance that directly disrupt cross‑border energy supply continuity.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">mid_east_energy_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
</edge>
<edge source="mid_east_energy_shock::sanctions_enforcement_in" target="us_china_trade_rivalry::chip_fab_capacity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter, more rigorously enforced sanctions on shipping, finance and intermediary suppliers restrict deliveries of specialized equipment and financing for fab projects, causing delays, cancellations or reduced throughput of advanced semiconductor fabs.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">mid_east_energy_shock</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_trade_rivalry</data>
</edge>
