  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A sustained rise in the pace of rerouting shipments away from Middle East chokepoints forces firms to source from additional geographies and build alternative logistics nodes, directly increasing the geographic spread of suppliers and production nodes.</data>
