  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.85</data>
  <data key="d36">Spikes in cross‑border kinetic and hybrid attacks create immediate market and policymaker fear of conflict spillover and supply disruption, raising perceived geopolitical risk relevant to US–China trade and investment decisions.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_trade_rivalry</data>
</edge>
