<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::energy_flow_stability" target="ai_safety_militarization::model_dev_velocity" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Interruptions or price spikes in cross‑border energy supplies force data centers and research facilities to curtail high‑intensity training workloads or postpone experiments, directly reducing the pace of model development.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">ai_safety_militarization</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::energy_flow_stability" target="global_rate_repricing::policy_interest_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in energy_flow_stability (more reliable cross‑border energy supplies) reduces headline energy-driven inflation and the upside shock to consumer prices, lowering the near‑term need for central banks to raise policy interest rates.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">global_rate_repricing</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::energy_flow_stability" target="mid_east_energy_shock::trade_rerouting_rate" id="0">
  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">Interruptions or volatility in cross‑border energy infrastructure (e.g., pipeline closures, damaged export terminals, or constrained shipping from Black Sea corridors) force traders and tankers to divert cargoes to alternative routes, ports or suppliers at an accelerated pace.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
  <data key="d39">mid_east_energy_shock</data>
</edge>
<edge source="russia_ukraine_war::energy_flow_stability" target="us_china_trade_rivalry::supply_chain_diversity" id="0">
