  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">Disruptions and volatility in energy supplies force firms to relocate or source energy‑intensive production and inputs from a wider set of countries, increasing geographic diversification of supply chains.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">russia_ukraine_war</data>
