  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.6</data>
  <data key="d36">A meaningful increase in advanced chip fabrication capacity eases semiconductor supply constraints, reducing projected goods-price pressures and precautionary term premia, which exerts downward pressure on longer-maturity nominal yields.</data>
