  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising perceived geopolitical risk prompts policymakers and oversight bodies to accelerate rulemaking, export vetting, and compliance enforcement targeted at AI capabilities, directly increasing regulatory scrutiny and obligations on developers.</data>
