  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">A spike in perceived geopolitical risk triggers a rapid risk-off reallocation and flight-to-safety, diverting portfolio and bank flows away from exposed jurisdictions into safe-haven currencies and assets, lowering net cross-border inflows to risky markets.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
