  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.75</data>
  <data key="d36">Rising policy interest rates increase borrowing costs and required returns for corporate overseas projects and make home-market assets more attractive, causing firms and investors to scale back or delay outbound FDI and cross-border deals.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_rate_repricing</data>
  <data key="d39">us_china_trade_rivalry</data>
