  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.9</data>
  <data key="d36">An increase in net cross-border capital flows raises available liquidity and financing for M&amp;A, greenfield projects and portfolio-backed expansions, directly boosting measured cross-border investment volumes.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">global_rate_repricing</data>
