  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">A spike in high-profile AI safety/security incidents drives immediate re‑risking as investors sell technology and growth equities and reallocate toward bonds and cash to avoid regulatory, litigation and operational losses.</data>
