  <data key="d33">+</data>
  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.55</data>
  <data key="d36">High-profile AI-related incidents (autonomous-weapon malfunctions, AI-driven cyberattacks on infrastructure) that can be attributed to conflict actors prompt rapid punitive responses, including expanded multilateral sanctions and export controls.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_safety_militarization</data>
  <data key="d39">russia_ukraine_war</data>
