  <data key="d28">2</data>
  <data key="d35">0.65</data>
  <data key="d36">High-profile AI safety or misuse incidents that are attributed to actors in the other country (or that cross borders) raise market and policymaker perceptions of threat and instability, increasing measured geopolitical risk between the US and China.</data>
