  <data key="d27">cross_causal</data>
  <data key="d33">-</data>
  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.7</data>
  <data key="d36">Tighter AI-specific rules, export controls and foreign-investment screenings directly block or delay cross-border M&amp;A, VC funding and portfolio investment into affected firms and jurisdictions, reducing net capital movements.</data>
  <data key="d37">0-6 months</data>
