  <data key="d28">3</data>
  <data key="d35">0.8</data>
  <data key="d36">New or intensified AI safety regulations create legal authorities and technical definitions that governments can immediately use to classify models/tools as controlled items, prompting stricter export licensing and denial criteria.</data>
  <data key="d37">6-18 months</data>
  <data key="d38">ai_safety_militarization</data>
